entries.def:
ἀγαλλιάω, -ῶ, Hellenistic form of cl. ἀγάλλω, to glorify, mid. -ομαι, to exult in; 
[in LXX (most frequently in Pss.) chiefly for גיל, רנן pi. ;] 
to exult, rejoice greatly: before ἐπί, with dative, Luk.1.47 with dative mod., 1Pe.1.8, Rev.19.7. Mid., with same sense: Mat.5.12, Luk.10.21, Act.2.26; 16.34, 1Pe.4.13; before ἵνα, Jhn.8.56 ἐν, Jhn.5.35 (1 aor. pass. perh. as mid.; but see Mozley, Psalter, 5), 1Pe.1.6…
